// The title and front-end rooms' sentences that are not inline pairs (ADR-0047): messages the game writes from a
// format and the title shows with Text.sentence, keyed by the English format exactly (%s a name or word). Labels and
// buttons on the title keep their Japanese inline, FoundryUi.text("Adventure", "冒険").
[
  {"en": "The saved run could not be continued (%s). It was kept as %s.", "to": "保存された冒険を続けられなかったよ（%s）。%s として残してあるよ。"}
]
